	<title>Caution Against Transacting Business With Unlicensed Virtual Asset Service Providers (VASPS) - NBFIRA</title>
	<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.nbfira.org.bw/news/caution-against-transacting-business-with-unlicensed-virtual-asset-service-providers-vasps/" />
	<meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
	<meta property="og:type" content="article" />
	<meta property="og:title" content="Caution Against Transacting Business With Unlicensed Virtual Asset Service Providers (VASPS) - NBFIRA" />
	<meta property="og:description" content="The Non-Bank Financial Institutions Regulatory Authority (NBFIRA) hereby cautions members of the public against transacting business with unlicensed virtual asset service providers including unlicensed online platforms. The following are the licensed virtual asset service providers in terms of the Virtual Assets Act, 2025, with no compliance issues: Section 9 of the Virtual Asset Act, 2025" />
	<meta property="og:url" content="https://www.nbfira.org.bw/news/caution-against-transacting-business-with-unlicensed-virtual-asset-service-providers-vasps/" />
