<div class="content-area">

	<article id="post-11910" class="post-11910 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-public-notices">
    <div class="entry-content consulting_elementor_wrapper">
                                                    <div class="row"><div class="col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="col_in __padd-right">                <div class="without_vc">
                                            <h1 class="h2 no_stripe page_title_2">Caution Against Transacting Business With Unlicensed Virtual Asset Service Providers (VASPS)</h1>                                        <div class="post_details_wr">
                        
<div class="stm_post_info">
	<div class="stm_post_details clearfix">
		<ul class="clearfix">
			<li class="post_date">
				<i class="fa fa fa-clock-o"></i>
				September 25, 2026			</li>
			<li class="post_by">Posted by:				<span>NBFIRA Media</span>
			</li>
			<li class="post_cat">Category:				<span>Public Notices</span>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<div class="comments_num">
			<a href="https://www.nbfira.org.bw/news/caution-against-transacting-business-with-unlicensed-virtual-asset-service-providers-vasps/#respond"><i class="fa fa-comment-o"></i>No Comments </a>
		</div>
	</div>
			<div class="post_thumbnail">
			<img width="1100" height="550" src="https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note.jpg" class="attachment-consulting-image-1110x550-croped size-consulting-image-1110x550-croped wp-post-image" alt="Public Notice Image" decoding="async" srcset="https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note.jpg 1100w, https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note-300x150.jpg 300w, https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note-1024x512.jpg 1024w, https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note-768x384.jpg 768w, https://www.nbfira.org.bw/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/public-note-900x450.jpg 900w" sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" />		</div>
	</div>                    </div>
                    <div class="wpb_text_column">
                        
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Non-Bank Financial Institutions Regulatory Authority (NBFIRA) hereby cautions members of the public against transacting business with unlicensed virtual asset service providers including unlicensed online platforms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The following are the licensed virtual asset service providers in terms of the Virtual Assets Act, 2025, with no compliance issues:</p>



<ol class="wp-block-list">
<li>Yellow Card Botswana (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Express Minds (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Temtum Services (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Kalahari Exchange (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Lebebe Au &amp; Bc (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Xago Technologies (Pty) Ltd</li>



<li>Transkalahari Advisory Group (Pty) Ltd</li>
</ol>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Section 9 of the Virtual Asset Act, 2025 states that:<br>“A person shall not carry out or participate in a virtual asset business, unless the person is the holder of a virtual asset service provider license issued in terms of section 11&#8230;”</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Section 36 of the Act further states that:<br>“A person who carries out a virtual asset business in contravention of this Act commits an offence and is liable, where no specific penalty is provided, to a fine not exceeding Pl 000 000, or imprisonment for a term not exceeding IO years, or to both&#8230;.”</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Important Reminder<br>The public is further cautioned that the use of any other VASP, than those listed above, including online platforms exposes consumers to significant risks, including financial loss, fraud, and absence of regulatory protection.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Contact NBFIRA<br>For verification or to report suspicious activities, please contact:<br>Non-Bank Financial Institutions Regulatory Authority (NBFIRA)<br>Tel: +267 3686100 / 3102595<br>Email: <a href="mailto:info@nbfira.org.bw">info@nbfira.org.bw</a><br>Website: <a href="http://www.nbfira.org.bw">www.nbfira.org.bw</a></p>
                    </div>
                    <br/>
                    <br/>
                    <div class="post_bottom media">
		</div>                                                                            </div>
                </div></div>                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-3 hidden-sm hidden-xs">                                                                                            		<div data-elementor-type="wp-post" data-elementor-id="10467" class="elementor elementor-10467" data-elementor-post-type="stm_vc_sidebar">
